* Procedure : SetLocPara.c2m
* Purpose : Set local TH parameters in each fuel Bundle
* Author : R. Guasch
* Date : 19/09/2024
* Updated : 06/06/2025 to support up to 90 and 100 axial nodes
* Update : 09/06/2025 : generated automatically by 'generate_c2m.py'
* Input data :
*  -Fmap : fuel map with local parameters to be modified/set
*  -THData : LCM object with entries ['TFuelList', 'TCoolList', 'DCoolList'] defining material properties 
*--------------
* INPUT - OUTPUT LCM data / parameters definition/recovery
*--------------
PARAMETER  Fmap THData ::
::: LINKED_LIST Fmap THData ; ;
*--------------
* MODULES definition
*--------------
MODULE GREP: RESINI: DELETE: END: ;
